# This repository is data and code. No Pokemon artwork is distributed here,
# and the rules below are written so that adding some by accident is not
# possible in one careless `git add`.

# ---- Artwork: deny by default -------------------------------------------
# Every image format, anywhere in the tree. The two 922-byte placeholders
# this project generated are the only exception, named explicitly so a new
# image cannot slip in beside them under a similar name.
*.png
*.gif
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.bmp
*.webp
*.tga
*.psd
*.xcf
*.ico
*.svg
!mod/assets/sets/placeholder/front.png
!mod/assets/sets/placeholder/back.png

# ---- Archives -------------------------------------------------------------
# The release zip at the root is the one archive this repository carries,
# and it is named explicitly.
*.zip
*.rar
*.7z
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
!national_dex-*.zip

# ---- The ROM and the engine -----------------------------------------------
*.gb
*.gbc
*.sav
/game/
/launcher/

# ---- Build output, caches and local notes ----------------------------------
/dist/
/reports/
/pokeapi_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md

# ---- Editor / OS ------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
*.bak
